    "description": "Engage and empower your team with the Legion Mobile app. In just a few taps, team members can keep you updated on their work preferences and availability, and Legion ensures that they are factored in the schedule. Notify team members when work schedules become available. Send targeted shift offers to available team members in real-time, drive team participation and ownership while fulfilling open shifts and callouts.",
